{"version":1,"title":"[楠竹蓮花集]2025 的 A - Z - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">文章</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/%E6%A5%A0%E7%AB%B9%E8%93%AE%E8%8A%B1%E9%9B%86/\">楠竹蓮花集</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">284 字 · 约 1 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2025-12-31T12:39:26.000Z\">2025-12-31</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-10-18T04:11:55.088Z\">2026-10-18</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[楠竹蓮花集]2025 的 A - Z</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><p>21 世纪就要过去 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 了。</p>\n<!--more-->\n<h1 id=\"A-Arduino\">A: Arduino</h1>\n<p>你好、再见、开灯、关灯……</p>\n<h1 id=\"B-Blog\">B: Blog</h1>\n<p>累计吹水 188k 字……</p>\n<h1 id=\"C-CS-for-Computer-Science\">C: CS for Computer Science</h1>\n<p>以熬夜，代码和调试闻名的学院。</p>\n<h1 id=\"D-Drawing\">D: Drawing</h1>\n<p>又菜又爱玩系列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"E-Earthquake\">E: Earthquake</h1>\n<p>人生第二次体验地震。</p>\n<h1 id=\"F-Fever\">F: Fever</h1>\n<p>每天一杯奶，自信引诱人。</p>\n<h1 id=\"G-Game\">G: Game</h1>\n<p>今天谁想玩游戏？</p>\n<h1 id=\"H-Huang\">H: Huang</h1>\n<p>一个姓氏。</p>\n<h1 id=\"I-Imagination\">I: Imagination</h1>\n<p>今年的确做了许多需要想象力的工作。</p>\n<h1 id=\"J-Jin\">J: Jin</h1>\n<p>年度汉字：進。</p>\n<h1 id=\"K-Kanaria\">K: Kanaria</h1>\n<p>“我让你听术力口了吗？”</p>\n<h1 id=\"L-Luv\">L: Luv</h1>\n<p>各种意义的爱。</p>\n<h1 id=\"M-Moving-House\">M: Moving House</h1>\n<p>搬进大豪斯了。</p>\n<h1 id=\"N-Nintendo\">N: Nintendo</h1>\n<p>旅行必备。</p>\n<h1 id=\"O-Objection\">O: Objection</h1>\n<p>声音从丹田发出，并且举起了食指！</p>\n<h1 id=\"P-Photograph\">P: Photograph</h1>\n<p>我们尼康拍猫猫也是很好的（指指点点）。</p>\n<h1 id=\"Q-Quarrel\">Q: Quarrel</h1>\n<p>装腔与滑跪。</p>\n<h1 id=\"R-Robot\">R: Robot</h1>\n<p>聊天 bot 高松灯制造了聊天 bot 寒曦。</p>\n<h1 id=\"S-Skiing\">S: Skiing</h1>\n<p>这辈子没见过这么多雪。</p>\n<h1 id=\"T-Travel\">T: Travel</h1>\n<p>请关注八纮九野集的更新。</p>\n<h1 id=\"U-UmiTaki\">U: UmiTaki</h1>\n<p>希！海！</p>\n<h1 id=\"V-Volunteer\">V: Volunteer</h1>\n<p>合法摸鱼。</p>\n<h1 id=\"W-Wind\">W: Wind</h1>\n<p>狂风大背头。</p>\n<h1 id=\"X-Xi-Chan\">X: Xi Chan</h1>\n<p>羲酱。</p>\n<h1 id=\"Y-YOASOBI\">Y: YOASOBI</h1>\n<p>恭喜 YOASOBI 双杀拿下我的 2025 年度歌手。</p>\n<h1 id=\"Z-Zi-Min\">Z: Zi Min</h1>\n<p>追星成功！</p>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}